                                        <div fed="main_content_column"
                    id="main-content-column"
                    class="col-12">
                    <p>
Select or enter vintage dates to download data for this series that actually existed on those past dates in history. 
In general, economic data for past observation periods are revised as more accurate estimates become available. 
Entering vintage dates allows you to retrieve past revisions of economic data that were actually available as of specific dates. 
</p>
<p> 
Read <a href="/help/downloaddata">Download Data Help</a> for more information about the options on this form.  
Note that files <strong>may take a while to download</strong> depending on the number of observations and vintage dates. 
</p>

<div id="series-download-data-form">
  <form name="form" method="post">
    <p>
      <strong>
        <label for="form_units" class="required">Units:</label>
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      <select id="form_units" name="form[units]">
                              <option value="lin" selected="selected">Percent</option>
                                        <option value="chg">Change, Percent</option>
                                        <option value="ch1">Change from Year Ago, Percent</option>
                                        <option value="pch">Percent Change</option>
                                        <option value="pc1">Percent Change from Year Ago</option>
                                        <option value="pca">Compounded Annual Rate of Change</option>
                                        <option value="cch">Continuously Compounded Rate of Change</option>
                                        <option value="cca">Continuously Compounded Annual Rate of Change</option>
                                        <option value="log">Natural Log of Percent</option>
                        </select>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/help#growth_formulas">Description of growth rate formulas</a>
      <label for="form_unitz" class="required">Note that units other than "Levels" are only available with output format "Observations by Vintage Date, All Observations"</label>
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>
        <label for="form_obs_start_date" class="required">Observation Range:</label>
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      <ul>
                              </ul>
      <input type="text" id="form_obs_start_date" name="form[obs_start_date]" required="required" maxlength="10" value="2015-01-01">
      to
      <input type="text" id="form_obs_end_date" name="form[obs_end_date]" required="required" maxlength="10" value="2028-01-01">
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>
        <label for="form_selected_vintage_dates">Select Vintage Dates When Data Were Revised:</label>
      </strong>
    </p>
    <ul>
          </ul>
    <p>
      <script type="text/javascript" language="javascript">
        function listbox_selectall(listID, isSelect) {
          var listbox = document.getElementById(listID);
          for(var count=0; count < listbox.options.length; count++) {
            listbox.options[count].selected = isSelect;
          }
        }
      </script>
    </p>
    <div id="svd">
      Select: <span onclick="listbox_selectall('form_selected_vintage_dates', true);" class="link svd">All</span>,
      <span onclick="listbox_selectall('form_selected_vintage_dates', false);" class="link">None</span>
    </div>
    <select id="form_selected_vintage_dates" name="form[selected_vintage_dates][]" size="10" style="height: 200px" multiple="multiple">
                        <option value="2015-12-16">2015-12-16</option>
                                <option value="2016-03-16">2016-03-16</option>
                                <option value="2016-06-15">2016-06-15</option>
                                <option value="2016-09-21">2016-09-21</option>
                                <option value="2016-12-14">2016-12-14</option>
                                <option value="2017-03-15">2017-03-15</option>
                                <option value="2017-06-14">2017-06-14</option>
                                <option value="2017-09-20">2017-09-20</option>
                                <option value="2017-12-13">2017-12-13</option>
                                <option value="2018-03-21">2018-03-21</option>
                                <option value="2018-06-13">2018-06-13</option>
                                <option value="2018-09-26">2018-09-26</option>
                                <option value="2018-12-19">2018-12-19</option>
                                <option value="2019-03-20">2019-03-20</option>
                                <option value="2019-06-19">2019-06-19</option>
                                <option value="2019-09-18">2019-09-18</option>
                                <option value="2019-12-11">2019-12-11</option>
                                <option value="2020-06-10">2020-06-10</option>
                                <option value="2020-09-16">2020-09-16</option>
                                <option value="2021-03-17">2021-03-17</option>
                                <option value="2021-06-16">2021-06-16</option>
                                <option value="2021-09-22">2021-09-22</option>
                                <option value="2021-12-15">2021-12-15</option>
                                <option value="2022-03-16">2022-03-16</option>
                                <option value="2022-06-15">2022-06-15</option>
                                <option value="2022-09-21">2022-09-21</option>
                                <option value="2022-12-14">2022-12-14</option>
                                <option value="2023-03-22">2023-03-22</option>
                                <option value="2023-06-14">2023-06-14</option>
                                <option value="2023-09-20">2023-09-20</option>
                                <option value="2023-12-13">2023-12-13</option>
                                <option value="2024-03-20">2024-03-20</option>
                                <option value="2024-06-12">2024-06-12</option>
                                <option value="2024-09-18">2024-09-18</option>
                                <option value="2024-12-18">2024-12-18</option>
                                <option value="2025-03-19">2025-03-19</option>
                                <option value="2025-06-18">2025-06-18</option>
                                <option value="2025-09-17">2025-09-17</option>
                  </select>
    <p>
      <label for="form_vintage_datez" class="required">Use the "Ctrl" key with the mouse pointer to select and deselect multiple vintage dates.  Use the "Shift" key with the mouse pointer to select the first and last vintage dates in a range.</label>
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>
        <label for="form_entered_vintage_dates">AND\OR Enter Vintage Dates:</label>
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      <input type="text" id="form_entered_vintage_dates" name="form[entered_vintage_dates]" maxlength="500">
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>
        <label for="form_file_type" class="required">Output Format:</label>
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      <select id="form_file_type" name="form[file_type]">
                              <option value="2" selected="selected">Observations by Vintage Date, All Observations</option>
          }
                              <option value="3">Observations by Vintage Date, New and Revised Observations Only</option>
          }
                              <option value="1">Observations by Real-Time Period</option>
          }
                              <option value="4">Observations, Initial Release Only</option>
          }
              </select>
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>
        <label for="form_file_format" class="required">File Format:</label>
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      <select id="form_file_format" name="form[file_format]">
                              <option value="xlsx" selected="selected">Excel</option>
                                        <option value="csv">Zipped CSV</option>
                        </select>
    </p>
    <p>
      <button type="submit" id="form_download_data" name="form[download_data]">Download data</button>
    </p>
  </form>
